@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title SS-14  Ask AI through chat
' Requirements: AI-01 AI-02 AI-03 AI-04 AI-05 AI-06 AI-07 REC-01 REC-02 REC-03 ROAD-01 ROAD-02 ROAD-03 PROFILE-01 DATA-01
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Student" as U
participant "CS-GAMUERS" as S
S --> U: Show reminder not to type personal information
U -> S: Send message in own conversation
note over U,S
Apply shared saved-outcome rules (diagram index / FC-07).
Resolve accessible success before new-generation checks:
no generation or extra usage, even at 20 used or during outage.
Permissions, privacy, deletion/expiry and current catalog apply.
end note
alt Accessible saved success for the same logical request
  S --> U: Return saved outcome; usage unchanged; show allowance/reset time
  note over U,S
  No course starts or roadmap activation on replay.
  Preview and explicit acceptance still required for proposals.
  end note
else Daily allowance exhausted or AI unavailable
  S --> U: Explain problem; retain readable history and core learning
else Personalization requested but profile incomplete
  S --> U: Request required profile answers; no personalized result yet
else Request can run
  note over S
  Automatically supplied context excludes name,
  student number, email, other students, and hidden answer keys.
  Student-written messages are sent as typed.
  end note
  alt Response fails
    S --> U: Explain failure; no allowance consumed or records changed
  else Response succeeds
    S --> U: Show response and remaining daily allowance
    note over S
    Count one request, including recommendations through chat.
    Retrying same successful request does not charge twice.
    end note
    opt Response suggests courses or a roadmap
      S --> U: Link to details or present proposed plan for review
      note over U,S
      Starting a course or accepting a plan uses
      the normal Student-controlled flow.
      AI cannot grade, award, publish, or approve accounts.
      end note
    end
  end
end
footer CS-GAMUERS | SS-14 | Product behavior
@enduml
